# Types: feat, fix, perf, refactor, docs, test, style, chore
# Scopes: hero, navbar, footer, animations, accessibility, performance, tests
# 
# Rules:
# - Use imperative mood in subject line
# - Don't capitalize first letter
# - Don't end subject line with period
# - Include CHANGELOG.md update in body when relevant
# - Reference issues/PRs in footer
#
# Example:
# feat(contact): add form validation with success animation
# 
# - Implement email validation with regex patterns
# - Add success state with confetti animation
# - Update CHANGELOG.md with new features
# - Add unit tests for form validation logic
#
